// Campaign: The Falling Empire
// Variables injected before each node: $player_faction, $enemy_faction
//
// IMPORTANT: Header separator must be exactly --- (three dashes). More or fewer dashes
// silently break YarnSpinner compilation and no narrative will play.
//
// Header fields:
//   level_seed: <int>   — fixed RNG seed (omit for random)
//   enemies_left: <int> — win when enemy fleets ≤ this
//   systems_left: <int> — win when enemy systems ≤ this
//   target_system_hops: <int> — win by capturing system N hops away
//   eliminate_target: true — win by eliminating a specific faction
//   defend: true        — lose if your starting system falls
//   timeout: <float>    — mission clock in seconds
//   description: <text> — shown in mission brief popup
//   win_text: <text>    — shown on victory end screen
//   on_win: <node>      — next node on victory
//   on_loss: <node>     — next node on defeat

title: mission_retreat
enemies_left: 0
defend: true
timeout: 300
description: Hold the bridgehead. Destroy every invading fleet.
win_text: The bridgehead remains within the domain of {$player_faction}.
on_win: mission_assault
on_loss: campaign_defeat
---

Narrator: {$player_faction} — Bridgehead Record.

Nest-Administrator: Shoal-Coordinator. Your precence sings to me!

Shoal-Coordinator: Nest-Administrator.

Nest-Administrator: The blight of our guardens, {$enemy_faction}, crossed the outer markers one cycle ago. Their lead shoals have entered our domain.

Shoal-Coordinator: With a larger contingency. 

Nest-Administrator: Yes.

The bridgehead is the youngest nesting system in this region, with chambers still in development.

{$player_faction} Mother-Leader assigned this system to us.

Shoal-Coordinator: Then we defend it.

Nest-Administrator:  Yes. Destroy every invading fleet.

===

title: mission_assault
target_system_hops: 3
description: Capture the marked system before {$enemy_faction} can reinforce it.
win_text: The marked system has entered the domain of {$player_faction}.
on_win: campaign_victory
on_loss: campaign_defeat
---

Narrator: {$player_faction} — Advance Record

Nest-Administrator: The bridgehead is stable.

Shoal-Coordinator: Then we continue.

Three crossings remain, {$enemy_faction} controls each of them.

The archive predicts resistance.

Advance through the defending shoals.

Establish a nesting hold before reinforcement arrives.

===

title: campaign_victory
---

Narrator: {$player_faction} — Sector Record

Nest-Administrator: The lattice has accepted the revision.

Shoal-Coordinator: {$enemy_faction} no longer maintains organized shoals in this sector.

The navigation lattice has expanded.

New nesting systems have entered the domain of {$player_faction}.

The Mother-Leader will receive the campaign record.

The next generation will hatch with different boundaries.

Orders will follow.

-> New Campaign
<<narrative_action "new_campaign">>
-> Random Missions
<<narrative_action "random_missions">>
-> Quit
<<narrative_action "quit">>

===

title: campaign_defeat
---

Narrator: {$player_faction} — Final Record

Nest-Administrator: The bridgehead is lost.

Shoal-Coordinator: Confirmed.

{$enemy_faction} now occupies this sector.

The navigation lattice has been revised.

The remaining shoals have altered their routes.

The Mother-Leader receives the final report.

-> New Campaign
<<narrative_action "new_campaign">>
-> Random Missions
<<narrative_action "random_missions">>
-> Quit
<<narrative_action "quit">>

===